1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Our hero wakes in a quiet town, unaware of the journey ahead.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,500
A mysterious letter arrives, calling him to adventure.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,500
He crosses the threshold, leaving everything familiar behind.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,500
Trials test his courage as shadows gather on the road.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,500
A mentor's gift reveals the strength he carried all along.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,500
In the darkest cavern, he faces the dragon of his own fear.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Victory won, he turns homeward with the elixir in hand.

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,000
He returns changed, and the town will never be the same.
